[1.947133, "o", "Initialized mnema project at ~/your-repository/.mnema\r\n"]
[1.94725, "o", "  identity: mnid:3561a2ee16e4e3d6ec2f6bda21bf1b0a928aae32c0929307959ef503f8b28947\r\n"]
[1.947321, "o", "  backup key: created and enrolled — private half at ~/.mnema/identity/backup/4207f6fc361541c35c6ec921494f2be650059e41f0b5605042de9c7caae07963.key\r\n  Move that file off this machine: a backup left on this disk is lost with it.\r\n"]
[1.947372, "o", "\r\n  mnema writes no file of yours. In Claude Code the mnema plugin hands this record to\r\n  each session on its own. Without it, `mnema brief > MNEMA.md` puts what governs this\r\n"]
[1.947399, "o", "  project in a file of its own — the `>` replaces the whole of the file it names — and\r\n  one line in a `CLAUDE.md` brings that file in (an `AGENTS.md` is read there only\r\n"]
[1.947467, "o", "  where no `CLAUDE.md` exists):\r\n    @MNEMA.md\r\n"]
[3.561285, "o", "\u001b[2m# write down a call, with the reasoning and what was turned down\u001b[0m\r\n"]
